                            "имеющий тёмные волосы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ee0a5f8-c02e-4bfc-b046-9d00a71423b1",
                                "sense_id": "363595bd-11d6-3e91-af04-e172afd17186",
                                "text": "Задрожавшими руками он сжал её кудрявую темноволосую голову."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "110a661e-512a-4007-b467-89f5d97092f5",
                                "sense_id": "363595bd-11d6-3e91-af04-e172afd17186",
                                "text": "С балкона осторожно заглядывал в комнату бритый, темноволосый, с острым носом, встревоженными глазами и со свешивающимся на лоб клоком волос человек примерно лет тридцати восьми."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ce2a536-a4c8-4d3e-ab35-65e0772552cc",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2aacb2f-406d-3d76-9fbd-6b7d956ab160",
                        "source_sense_id": "363595bd-11d6-3e91-af04-e172afd17186",
                        "target_lang_word": "dark-haired",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dark-haired",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a1da85f-0859-3ee0-87c8-1b27ec57654d",
                                        "entry_id": "9bbbcc8b-3586-3213-84d1-7f51da03949f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having hair of a dark color, usually dark brown."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "378fe0c2-0c79-4292-ade8-710061d5eb94",
                                                "sense_id": "9a1da85f-0859-3ee0-87c8-1b27ec57654d",
                                                "text": "And M. [Henri-François-Alphonse] Esquiros, in describing the Dutch generally, speaks of beauties both blondes and brunettes, ‘for black hair is not uncommon in the Netherlands.’ These words seem to imply that black hair does not preponderate; and, if not, there must be a marked difference between the Dutch and the English. Here again is confirmation of the opinion that the modern English are somewhat more dark-haired than the ancient Saxons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78ed033e-a47d-47b9-bfe4-6196b23799fb",
                                                "sense_id": "9a1da85f-0859-3ee0-87c8-1b27ec57654d",
                                                "text": "Perhaps people felt by some form of symbolism or imitative magic that if the very first foot over the threshold was that of a dark-haired man, so might that hearth be safe for a whole year from the marauding Northmen. We listened to the chimes of Big Ben on the radio, and then as the last notes of the Old Year died away, Humphrey, who was the darkest-haired man present, ran to the door so as to come in and first foot us."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39290d2b-7b2d-457f-b0ba-54d41802274d",
                                                "sense_id": "9a1da85f-0859-3ee0-87c8-1b27ec57654d",
                                                "text": "Maura was sixteen, with the Salter good looks. Darker-haired than her big sister Bridie, but she had the same soft grace."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7fe3136c-b3b1-444f-8610-d68fd5929982",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2aacb2f-406d-3d76-9fbd-6b7d956ab160",
                        "source_sense_id": "363595bd-11d6-3e91-af04-e172afd17186",
                        "target_lang_word": "dunkelhaarig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dunkelhaarig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b2beec2-e91b-3c5b-b7e9-ff7b7ca9a06b",
                                        "entry_id": "d28036ba-147c-32cf-9e18-efe087589d42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine dunkle Haarfarbe habend (schwarz, dunkelbraun)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11ea248f-c743-4c87-b446-292f6fc7243f",
                                                "sense_id": "6b2beec2-e91b-3c5b-b7e9-ff7b7ca9a06b",
                                                "text": "„Blonde Schweden ehelichten in Mittelalter und Neuzeit eher andere blonde Schweden als dunkelhaarige Italiener.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76f53d76-e468-4036-8a16-d857b8f2bb80",
                                                "sense_id": "6b2beec2-e91b-3c5b-b7e9-ff7b7ca9a06b",
                                                "text": "„Die Forscher hatten die DNA von 43 blonden und 42 dunkelhaarigen Salomonern untersucht und waren dabei auf eine Genmutation am Chromosom neun gestoßen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "207503b9-c65b-4111-8b8c-eb33a0d314e1",
                                                "sense_id": "6b2beec2-e91b-3c5b-b7e9-ff7b7ca9a06b",
                                                "text": "„Sie war eine dunkelhaarige Schönheit mit einer Figur, bei deren Anblick den anderen Patienten der Mund offen stehen blieb.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb0a4aef-cb94-4f65-805b-15d3f349af42",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2aacb2f-406d-3d76-9fbd-6b7d956ab160",
                        "source_sense_id": "363595bd-11d6-3e91-af04-e172afd17186",
                        "target_lang_word": "donkerharig",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "donkerharig",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30fbffee-2f3a-3f19-87ad-e8f53df9d0fb",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf6e9f7-7e3a-3569-97ac-2b5067d11f39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Veel meisjes uit Iran zijn mooie, donkerharige prinsesjes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "177ac200-43b2-480e-b713-528534646451",
                                                "sense_id": "30fbffee-2f3a-3f19-87ad-e8f53df9d0fb",
                                                "text": "Dagen achter elkaar was er niemand te bekennen, waardoor ik me nog kwetsbaarder voelde, en ik begon bij elke bocht hard te zingen om eventuele beren te waarschuwen dat ik eraan kwam. Ik tikte mijn wandelstokken tegen elkaar en sloeg onverstaanbare wartaal uit. Mijn ogen schoten onzeker alle kanten op, speurend naar kleine bewegingen en donkerharige wezens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c130b9b-21cf-402f-92d8-e05395afcf07",
